}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T14:30:10Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T16:05:34Z","body":"> * Using **Download Backup** in the project manager doesn't use the same file name as **Project > Tools > Download Project Source** in the editor:\r\n\r\nDone\r\n\r\n> * **Edit:** The above is being done by #123525, although it doesn't hide the original **Pack Project as ZIP** option.\r\n\r\nThe entire \"Export Project\" workflow does not work for web afaik, [in the documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/editor/using_the_web_editor.html#limitations) it explicitly says you should downlaod the project and open it in a desktop version of the editor to export the project.\r\n**Edit:** Ah now i see you was referring to a menu option i didn't know about. Sorry, my bad. I removed it in #123525\r\n>> No project exporting. As a workaround, you can download the project source using Project > Tools > Download Project Source and export it using a [native version of the Godot editor](https://godotengine.org/download).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5816122983/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5817609203","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123149#issuecomment-5817609203","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123149","id":5817609203,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWsGr8w","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu